Tailscale auth key should be passed through the provision `--extraFiles` command.

They should not be added to sops. Auth keys should be one-time use keys.

Only the OAuth key, with limited decryptors, should be in sops.

This also adds some more resilience to a system. If it's enrolled in tailscale, issues in secrets decryption (might actually break nixos activation, not sure) won't affect our ability to re-provision.

Age key should also be passed through extraFiles.